How I found the password:

In the function checkPassword, we take some string of text as an input in the parameter, and check if it is matching with our password (string of text). After that, it returns whether it is a matching text or not, i.e., if the password is correct.

Hence, the password was just sitting there in the source code. That is how I found it, and then put it in the flag format.

This is also why it is not safe for passwords to be kept in the source code, since if anyone gets access to the source code, our password is compromised.
